This repository contains the standalone ComfyUI node implementation.
It integrates the Krea2 SingleStreamDiT and LoRA bypass APIs provided by
ComfyUI (https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI).
The compiled block wrapper follows the upstream Krea2 block's mathematical
sequence; the native model and adapter calculations remain upstream code.
ComfyUI and its contributors retain their respective copyrights.

The included source is distributed under GNU GPL version 3; see LICENSE.
Model weights, ComfyUI itself, Python environments and compiled caches are
not included. Model and third-party dependency licenses remain applicable.
